    internalName: "Brand New 2-Bedroom Leasehold Villa Lod",
    description: "Brand new 2 bedroom for lease in the South of Ubud, Lodtunduh area.\nAround 10 minutes to Titi Batu Ubud Club and 15'20 minutes to Ubud center.\nConvenient location with easy access while staying in a calm residential area.\n\nModern villa with a bright and pleasant atmosphere, fully new and ready to move in. The property combines a clean contemporary design with warm natural materials and high quality finishes, creating a comfortable home and a strong investment option.\n\nFeatures a fully enclosed kitchen and living room with air conditioning and a TV. The European style kitchen is modern and well equipped, including a large double door refrigerator. The dining area connects naturally with the living space, making it practical for everyday living and hosting guests.\n\nBoth bedrooms are designed in a hotel style, finished with wood elements throughout. Each bedroom has a large wardrobe with a mirror, air conditioning, and an elegant bathroom. The bathrooms are finished with high quality natural stone tiles and include a bathtub, creating a refined and comfortable feel.\n\nOutside, the villa offers a swimming pool, an outdoor shower, and a cozy covered chill area with a leather sofa overlooking the pool. The land is well arranged, bright, and easy to maintain. A dedicated private parking area of 100 sqm adds strong practical value.\n\n\n• Land size 200 sqm.\n• 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.\n• Fully enclosed kitchen and living room.\n• Modern European kitchen with double door refrigerator.\n• Hotel style bedrooms with wooden finishes.\n• Bathrooms with natural stone tiles and bathtub.\n• Swimming pool and outdoor shower.\n• Covered lounge area with pool view.\n• Dedicated parking area 100 sqm.\n• Fully furnished.\n• Bright, new, and move in ready.",
