    description: "Two bedroom villa in the south of Ubud, Lodtunduh area.\nWide open rice field views combined with privacy and greenery.\nAround 4 km or approximately 10 minutes drive to Titi Batu Club, and 15–20 minutes to Ubud center depending on traffic.\n\nA bright and well designed two bedroom villa set in a natural environment. The villa offers an open view over the fields while still feeling private and calm. A large, well maintained garden surrounds the house, creating a pleasant and spacious atmosphere.\n\nThe swimming pool is big and thoughtfully designed, becoming a central feature of the outdoor area. The kitchen is built as a separate structure facing the pool, which gives a nice layout and keeps the living spaces open and airy. Please note that the kitchen is not shown in the photos.\n\nThe villa is furnished with modern, high quality furniture and has a clean, light interior. One of the bathrooms includes a bathtub. There is also a dedicated parking space for a car.\n\n– 2 bedrooms.\n– Open rice field view with privacy.\n– Large natural garden.\n– Big designer swimming pool.\n– Separate kitchen facing the pool.\n– Modern design and quality furniture.\n– Bathtub.\n– Parking space for a car.\n– Bright and clean atmosphere.\n\nCleaning is included.\nElectricity is paid separately.",
