    internalName: "Villa Pondok Uma Sari 2bdr",
    description: "New two bedroom villa in the south of Ubud, Lodtunduh area.\nAround 5 minutes or 2 km to Titi Batu Club Ubud and Usha Cafe.\nApproximately 10 minutes to Ubud center. Located close to the main crossroads of Lodtunduh, with easy access towards Sanur, Denpasar, and Canggu.\n\nA recently built two bedroom villa, all new and ready to move in. You will be among the first guests. One of the main advantages of this property is its strategic location, combining quick access to key places with a calm and green environment.\n\nThe villa is spacious and filled with natural light. A glass fence opens the view to greenery and nature, creating a feeling of space while keeping the area clean and dry. The territory is well planned and comfortable for everyday living.\n\nCar access is available, with parking space for both a car and a scooter, which is a valuable feature in this area.\n\n– 2 bedrooms.\n– Recently built, first guests.\n– Green view through a glass fence.\n– Spacious and bright layout.\n– Dry and clean environment.\n– Car and scooter access with parking.\n– Excellent location near Titi Batu and Lodtunduh crossroads.\n\nElectricity is separate.\nIncluded in the price: Cleaning twice a week, Pool cleaning once a week, Drinking water, Gas, Trash removal, Linen change once a week.\n",
