    internalName: "Brand new 2bdr from Yulia Niki sister",
    description: "Brand new 2 bedroom villa with a closed kitchen in the South of Ubud, Lodtunduh area. 11 minutes to Titi Batu Ubud Club and around 20 minutes to Ubud Center.\n\nFully new and never rented before. You will be the first guest.\n\nThis villa offers a rare setup for Ubud, featuring a fully enclosed kitchen in a separate room instead of the typical open plan kitchen living space. The kitchen is equipped with cookware, a steamer, and a juicer, making it convenient for everyday use.\n\nThe living area includes a cozy sofa, a black ceiling fan, and a designer chest of drawers, creating a stylish and comfortable atmosphere.\n\nEach bedroom comes with air conditioning, a large low wooden bed made from quality wood, a comfortable mattress, a mirror, a small table, and a chair. The bathrooms feature beautiful tiles, black showers, and built in wall niches for toiletries. The shower area receives natural light from above.\n\nThe property has its own private territory with a small garden and a private swimming pool, offering a calm and pleasant environment.\n\n– 2 bedrooms with air conditioning.\n– Fully enclosed kitchen in a separate room.\n– Living room with sofa and black ceiling fan.\n– Designer furniture.\n– Kitchen equipped with steamer and juicer.\n– Stylish bathrooms with black showers.\n– Private swimming pool.\n– Small garden.\n– Never rented before.\n\nIncluding cleaning and WiFi. Electricity is separate.\n",
