    description: "One bedroom two storey villa in the center of Seminyak, available for monthly or yearly rent. Located next to a traditional market, 3 minutes to Pepito, Festive, and Starbucks. Around 5 minutes to Ku De Ta and Petitenget Beach.\n\nModern private villa in a prime Seminyak location, offering a rare combination of central access and comfort. The property features a beautiful swimming pool and a contemporary design with stylish furniture throughout.\n\nFully enclosed living room and kitchen on the ground floor. The kitchen is equipped with an extractor hood above the stove and designed for comfortable everyday cooking. There is a cozy sofa in the living area, as well as a guest toilet on the first floor, meaning the villa offers two toilets in total.\n\nUpstairs, the bedroom features air conditioning, a large TV, a beautiful wooden floor, and modern furnishings that create a warm and comfortable atmosphere.\n\nThis property stands out with electricity already included in both monthly and yearly prices, which is a rare and valuable benefit.\n\nKey highlights include a modern design, a nice private pool, an enclosed kitchen and living space, a guest toilet downstairs, and a top tier central Seminyak location.\n\n– One bedroom with air conditioning.\n– Two storey building.\n– Cozy swimming pool.\n– Fully enclosed kitchen and living room.\n– Extractor hood above the stove.\n– Guest toilet on the ground floor.\n– Large TV in the bedroom.\n– Wooden floor in the bedroom.\n– High speed WiFi 400.\n– Modern design and furniture.\n\nThe villa is available from 21 February, but viewings can be arranged in advance.\n\nAlready included:\n– Electricity.\n– Cleaning twice a week.\n– Pool maintenance twice a week.\n– Linen and towel change once a week.\n",
