    internalName: "4.6 billion Jalan Cinta 3bdr",
    description: "Brand new freehold three bedroom villa in the north of Ubud.\nLocation on Google Maps nearby Huma Cafe by Goldmine, Jalan Cinta.\nAround 12–15 minutes to Ubud center. A quiet and scenic area, considered one of the most beautiful roads in Ubud.\n\nA two story modern villa set in a calm natural environment with stunning open views over the rice fields. Large floor to ceiling glass windows bring a lot of light inside and create a strong connection with nature. Fresh air, greenery, and a peaceful atmosphere define this location.\n\nThe living space is fully enclosed and spacious, combining a closed kitchen and living room with a TV. The kitchen is large, fully equipped, and designed for comfortable everyday use. A balcony on the upper floor opens wide views over the fields and surrounding landscape.\n\nThe swimming pool measures 9 x 3 meters and is well integrated into the territory. The villa is built on 2 are of land and offers a practical layout suitable for both living and investment purposes. Access is by scooter only, but the villa is located close to the main road.\n\n– Freehold ownership.\n– 3 bedrooms.\n– 3.5 bathrooms.\n– Two story building.\n– Closed kitchen and living room.\n– Large glass windows with rice field views.\n– Balcony with open scenery.\n– Swimming pool 9 x 3 meters.\n– Parking for 4 scooters and 1 car.\n– Electricity 7,500 PLN.\n– Borehole water.\n– Permit for tourist lounge use.\n– PBG 2024.\n– Calm and highly scenic location.\n\nPrice: 4,600,000,000 IDR.\nFreehold.\nOther lease options are negotiable.\n\nPlease send me a message or leave a comment below and I will answer you.",
