    id: "prop-15-26",
    villaNumber: "15",
    internalName: "Casa D Arta, Agus, 4 bdr",
    description: "A special four bedroom villa for rent in the northwest of Ubud, Kedewatan area, north of Penestanan.\nAround 3 minutes to the new Pepito Kedewatan, 10 minutes to Bintang supermarket, and approximately 13 minutes to Ubud center. A very convenient location with quick access both to Ubud and to the northern direction of Bali.\n\nThis villa has a unique character and atmosphere, created for people who value space, creativity, and a deeper connection with their surroundings. The owner is an artist, and this feeling is reflected in the layout and energy of the house.\n\nThe villa is especially well suited for yoga retreats, wellness practices, workshops, or a group of people living together. It can also be a great option for a family who appreciates traditional Balinese houses and a calm, meaningful lifestyle.\n\nThe property consists of two stories and offers four bedrooms, two kitchens with a dining area, and an additional open space ideal for yoga, meditation, or creative activities. The private swimming pool is located in the center of the plot, creating a beautiful and almost magical atmosphere, especially in the evening, with views of the moon and starry sky.\n\nThe location is also a strong advantage. It is close to the main road leading north from Ubud, giving easy access to outdoor activities such as quad biking, river rafting, and direct routes towards Kintamani.\n\n– 4 bedrooms.\n– Two story villa.\n– Two kitchens and dining area.\n– Dedicated space for yoga or meditation.\n– Private swimming pool in the center of the property.\n– Artistic and creative atmosphere.\n– Great for retreats, workshops, or group living.\n– Close to new Pepito Kedewatan.\n– Easy access to northern Bali and outdoor activities.",
