    id: "prop-35-27",
    villaNumber: "35",
    internalName: "Asri Cinta",
    description: "A brand new one-bedroom two-storey villa for rent in the north of Ubud. Approximately 15 minutes to the center of Ubud, in a quiet and green location with views of the rice fields. The villa is part of a managed complex, offering privacy, comfort, and a modern European-style design.\n\nThe villa features a spacious and bright bedroom with a balcony, a bathroom with a separate shower and bathtub, a closed kitchen, and a guest toilet on the ground floor. Large windows provide plenty of natural light throughout the villa, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The interior is furnished with designer furniture, high ceilings, and modern finishing touches. A private swimming pool adds to the sense of comfort and relaxation. Harman Kardon speakers and storage cabinets are included, as well as air conditioning in the bedroom.\n\nThis property is ideal for those seeking a quiet and comfortable stay in Ubud, with easy access to both central Ubud and the surrounding natural areas. Cleaning and Wi-Fi are included, and electricity is covered up to 1 million IDR.\n\n– 1 bedroom, two-storey villa\n– Private swimming pool\n– Closed kitchen\n– Guest toilet on ground floor\n– Bedroom with balcony\n– Bathroom with separate shower and bathtub\n– Storage cabinets\n– Air conditioning\n– Designer furniture and high ceilings\n– Plenty of natural light\n\nSecurity deposit 2,000,000 IDR (refundable).\n\nPlease send me a message or leave a comment below and I will answer you.",
