    internalName: "Villa 8 Units Yulia Niki lease 30 years",
    description: "An 8-bedroom villa complex for lease in the south of Ubud, Lodtunduh area, Kecamatan. Around 10 minutes to Titi Batu Club Ubud and approximately 15–20 minutes to Ubud center.\n\nThis is a fully operational hospitality business offered on a long-term 30-year lease. The complex is already running, has strong ratings and positive reviews on Booking and Agoda, and can be taken over as a ready-made investment with existing reputation and demand.\n\nThe property consists of eight independent villas: four solid concrete villas and four wooden villas, creating a balanced mix of durability and traditional Balinese character. Each villa is fully self-contained, with its own private kitchen, living room, and a bathroom with a bathtub.\n\nIn addition to the private units, the complex includes shared infrastructure that supports hotel-style operations and guest comfort. A spacious lobby, a public kitchen, public toilets, an office, storage areas, and a dedicated villa temple are all part of the property. There is ample parking on site.\n\nThe large central swimming pool overlooks open rice fields and offers a rare view towards Mount Agung, adding strong visual and emotional value for guests and making the complex especially attractive for long stays and retreats.\n\n– 8 villas total: 4 concrete and 4 wooden.\n– All rooms with bathtubs.\n– Private kitchen and living room in each villa.\n– Fully operational business with online presence and reviews.\n– Lobby area.\n– Public kitchen and public toilets.\n– Office space.\n– Storage room.\n– Villa temple.\n– Large swimming pool.\n– Open rice field and Mount Agung view.\n– Parking area.\n– Strong investment opportunity.",
